  "method": "Validated the complete China ZIP size and SHA-256 plus both archived member sizes and CRC values; streamed every national CSV record; selected provisional SITE-001 centroids and stable GERS matches; linked current Overture non-OSM features by stable GERS id; linked OSM features only through one-to-one centroid coverage and canonical-to-OBAT area similarity; retained unmatched selected rows; and did not alter statutory or survey fields.",
